de (Hell Difficulty):</strong> An extra difficulty unlocked after completing the story. True mastery required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social &amp; Fun Mechanics:</strong> Ease the tension with lobby activities, dance menus, and interactive objects (boombox and more).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Customization:</strong> Personalize your character with a wide range of accessories and outfits.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crucial Gameplay Warning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important:</strong> We strongly recommend completing the short <strong>Tutorial</strong> or watching the <strong>Training Video</strong> on our YouTube channel before diving in. LunHowl is an intense, high-paced experience that demands precise interactions (using the ‘E’ key) while moving. Come prepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/dbefa07fb9c6601ba9ca409e19fbde10.poster.avif?t=1788487998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/dbefa07fb9c6601ba9ca409e19fbde10.webm?t=1788487998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/dbefa07fb9c6601ba9ca409e19fbde10.mp4?t=1788487998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/f409ea6b6a9a6650730b5a70abe9e9e7.poster.avif?t=1788487998\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/f409ea6b6a9a6650730b5a70abe9e9e7.webm?t=1788487998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614690/extras/f409ea6b6a9a6650730b5a70abe9e9e7.mp4?t=1788487998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[DLC Supporter Pack Benefits]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting the game! By purchasing the DLC pack you receive:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exclusive Lobby View:</strong> Stand out with a special <strong>blue-themed</strong> lobby background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All Customization Unlocked:</strong> Instant unlimited access to every costume and accessory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Special Discord Role:</strong> Claim your exclusive <strong>&quot;DLC Supporter&quot;</strong> role on our Discord server.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access &amp; Community Call</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am the sole developer of LunHowl. The game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong> and you may encounter bugs or balancing issues. Please join our <strong>Discord server</strong> for feedback, bug reports, and discussion — your support directly shapes the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook or Die. Let the Nightmare begin.</strong></p>",
